add('All author/build/test jobs stop before sequential native, Node and bounded browser measurements. Individual paired median-bootstrap 95% intervals use 4,000 Random(0) draws. They are exploratory, correlated and unadjusted for multiple comparisons. All browser groups and raw frames are retained; startup sums contexts, while the merged cold-call map describes only the first context. No source, fixture, control or policy is tuned from timings.\n')
add(f'Totals: **{v["timing_samples"]:,} samples, {v["exact_benchmark_comparisons"]:,} complete benchmark comparisons, {v["web_intervals_independently_recomputed"]+v["native_intervals_independently_recomputed"]:,} independently recomputed intervals**. Compiler SHA `{m["compiler_sha256"]}`.\n')
